These LCAO and PW rt-TDDFT cases share input files and reference values between CPU and GPU runs. Ordinary cases omit ks_solver so ABACUS selects the default solver for the basis, device, and build configuration.

From this directory, run CPU cases with:
bash ../integrate/Autotest.sh -a /absolute/path/to/abacus -n 4 -f CASES_CPU.txt

For GPU runs, first replace or append device gpu in each INPUT in a separate working copy, then run:
bash ../integrate/Autotest.sh -a /absolute/path/to/abacus -n 2 -f CASES_GPU.txt

Selecting CASES_GPU.txt alone does not change the device. The CUDA workflow performs the device conversion before running these shared cases.
